    "commit": {
      "message": "Fix XDM Android field download actions storage and sniffing"
    },
    "notes": [
      "This is a post-D7 field bugfix overlay, not a new Debug Workbench D-series phase.",
      "Download item actions now dispatch explicitly instead of collapsing to the details sheet.",
      "Normal UI explains Android shared-storage handles with human labels rather than raw destination values.",
      "Media page probes attach safe browser-like headers and return a clear blocked-site diagnostic for HTTP 401/403 instead of throwing opaque failures.",
      "Firefox extension detection now requires stronger media evidence and filters JSON/API false positives inspired by behavioral signals observed in the supplied 1DM APK string scan, without copying implementation code.",
      "No Room migration, new top-level route, background upload, all-files permission, or Debug Workbench expansion is included."
    ]
